sequenceDiagram
    participant T as tool call
    participant O as orchestrator
    participant S as source plan
    participant V as Vcs
    T->>O: exec or upload
    O->>V: read synced and the two tips
    O->>S: classify
    alt the branch moved
        O->>V: observe the workspace
        O->>S: plan
        O->>V: adopt or block
    end
    O->>T: run the tool
    O->>V: observe the workspace
    O->>S: plan Snapshot
    O->>V: snapshot and advance
    O-->>T: result with the state
